// A server whose binary has NO checkout above it must refuse, never adopt its working directory as
// a repo root. `RootWalk.maxon` carries the full account: this is the only test in the suite that
// can see that bug, and it costs a binary copy to run.

test 'a server outside every checkout refuses instead of adopting its working directory'
	try RootWalk.check()
end 'a server outside every checkout refuses instead of adopting its working directory'
